    {
      "id": "q016",
      "label": "（16）",
      "type": "composite",
      "stem": "已知函数 $f(x)=A\\sin(\\omega x+\\frac{\\pi}{3})$（$\\omega>0$）两个相邻零点的距离为 $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$，且 $f(0)=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$.",
      "score": 13,
      "pages": [
        3
      ],
      "parts": [
        {
          "id": "p1",
          "label": "（Ⅰ）",
          "type": "calculation",
          "stem": "求 $A,\\omega$ 的值；",
          "answer": {
            "source": "question_document",
            "content": "$A=1$，$\\omega=2$"
          },
          "analysis": [
            "因为 $f(0)=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$，所以 $A\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{3}=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}A=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$．所以 $A=1$.",
            "因为 $f(x)$ 的两个相邻零点的距离为 $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$，所以 $f(x)$ 的最小正周期 $T=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot 2=\\pi$.",
            "所以 $\\frac{2\\pi}{\\omega}=\\pi$.",
            "所以 $\\omega=2$，$f(x)=\\sin(2x+\\frac{\\pi}{3})$."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p2",
          "label": "（Ⅱ）",
          "type": "calculation",
          "stem": "设 $g(x)=f(x)-2\\sqrt3\\cos^2 x$，求 $g(x)$ 的单调递增区间.",
          "answer": {
            "source": "question_document",
            "content": "$\\left[k\\pi-\\frac{\\pi}{12},k\\pi+\\frac{5\\pi}{12}\\right],k\\in\\mathbf{Z}$"
          },
          "analysis": [
            "由（Ⅰ）可得，$f(x)=\\sin(2x+\\frac{\\pi}{3})$，所以 $g(x)=\\sin(2x+\\frac{\\pi}{3})-2\\sqrt3\\cos^2 x$",
            "$=\\sin(2x+\\frac{\\pi}{3})-\\sqrt3(\\cos2x+1)$",
            "$=\\frac12\\sin2x+\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\cos2x-\\sqrt3(\\cos2x+1)$",
            "$=\\frac12\\sin2x-\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\cos2x-\\sqrt3$",
            "$=\\sin(2x-\\frac{\\pi}{3})-\\sqrt3$.",
            "令 $2k\\pi-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\le2x-\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\le2k\\pi+\\frac{\\pi}{2}$，解得 $k\\pi-\\frac{\\pi}{12}\\le x\\le k\\pi+\\frac{5\\pi}{12}$.",
            "$g(x)$ 的单调递增区间为 $\\left[k\\pi-\\frac{\\pi}{12},k\\pi+\\frac{5\\pi}{12}\\right],k\\in\\mathbf{Z}$."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "materials": [
        "m003"
      ]
    },
